sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Engineer
    participant CLI as rhai-cli
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI REST API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2
    participant FS as Filesystem<br/>/tmp/rhoai-upgrade-backup/
    participant GitHub as odh-gitops<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(e.g. Claude)

    Note over User,FS: Flow 1: Upgrade Readiness Assessment (lint)
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli lint --target-version X.Y
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET CRDs (DSC, DSCI, ISVCs,<br/>Notebooks, Kueue, DSPA, etc.)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: CR states, operator versions
    CLI->>CLI: Execute 48 checks<br/>(5 groups: deps, service,<br/>platform, component, workload)
    CLI-->>User: Structured results<br/>(table/JSON/YAML)<br/>Severity: prohibited/blocking/<br/>advisory/informational

    Note over User,FS: Flow 2: Migration Action Execution (migrate run)
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli migrate run<br/>--action rhbok --target-version X.Y
    CLI->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(RBAC preflight check)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Access granted
    CLI->>K8sAPI: GET current state<br/>(ClusterQueues, ConfigMaps, DSC)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Current resources
    CLI->>FS: Backup resources<br/>(YAML files)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: PATCH DSC, label namespaces,<br/>create Subscriptions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Updated resources
    CLI->>CLI: Verify migration<br/>(exponential backoff polling)
    CLI->>TrustyAI: GET /metrics (backup)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>TLS: InsecureSkipVerify
    TrustyAI-->>CLI: Scheduled metrics data
    CLI-->>User: Migration results

    Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Flow 3: MCP AI Agent Integration
    Agent->>CLI: MCP tool call (stdio or SSE/8080)<br/>No auth (localhost only)
    CLI->>CLI: Map tool args to cobra flags
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Execute CLI command<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: API response
    CLI-->>Agent: Structured JSON result<br/>(stdio or SSE)

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 4: Workload Backup Export
    User->>CLI: rhai-cli backup --namespace NS
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Discovery: list workload CRDs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Workload resources
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Resolve dependencies<br/>(ConfigMaps, Secrets, PVCs)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Dependent resources
    CLI->>FS: Write YAML files
    CLI-->>User: Backup complete
